---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | PlatAlt" currentPage="">

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-16">
  <div class="mb-12">
    <p class="text-tertiary-fixed-dim text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="font-headline text-5xl md:text-6xl font-light text-primary-container mb-6">Privacy <span class="italic">Policy</span></h1>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant">Last updated: January 1, 2025</p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none space-y-10 text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl text-primary-container mb-4">1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>PlatAlt Management LLP ("PlatAlt", "we", "us", or "our") operates PlatAlt platform. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and safeguard information you provide when using our website and services. By accessing our platform, you consent to the practices described in this policy.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl text-primary-container mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We may collect the following categories of information:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 pl-4">
        {[
          'Identity information: Full legal name, entity name, PAN/TAN, and government-issued identification',
          'Contact information: Email address, phone number, registered office address',
          'Financial information: Investment objectives, risk tolerance, net worth declarations (for KYC/AML purposes)',
          'Usage data: Pages visited, time spent, referral sources, browser type, and IP address',
          'Communication records: Correspondence with our advisory and compliance teams',
        ].map(item => (
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary-fixed-dim text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0">check_small</span>
            <span class="text-sm">{item}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl text-primary-container mb-4">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Information is used exclusively for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 pl-4">
        {[
          'Processing your registration and onboarding as a sophisticated investor',
          'Providing access to fund information, analytics, and advisory services',
          'Compliance with SEBI AIF Regulations and PMLA requirements',
          'Communicating fund updates, regulatory notices, and investor reports',
          'Improving platform functionality and user experience',
        ].map(item => (
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary-fixed-dim text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0">check_small</span>
            <span class="text-sm">{item}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl text-primary-container mb-4">4. Data Sharing & Disclosure</h2>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. Information may be shared with: (a) SEBI, PMLA-designated authorities, and other regulatory bodies when legally required; (b) Registered fund managers and trustees of AIFs in which you invest; (c) SEBI-registered KYC Registration Agencies (KRAs) for investor verification; (d) Auditors, legal advisors, and technology service providers under strict confidentiality agreements.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl text-primary-container mb-4">5. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We employ industry-standard encryption (AES-256 at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit), multi-factor authentication, and role-based access controls. Our infrastructure undergoes annual penetration testing and is ISO 27001 aligned. Despite these measures, no digital transmission is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl text-primary-container mb-4">6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Subject to applicable law, you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data. To exercise these rights, contact our Data Protection Officer at <span class="text-secondary">privacy@alternavest.in</span>. We respond to verified requests within 30 business days.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl text-primary-container mb-4">7. Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy-related inquiries: PlatAlt Management LLP, Data Protection Office, One BKC, Mumbai – 400 051. Email: privacy@alternavest.in</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
    <a href="/terms" class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary hover:text-primary-container transition-colors">Terms of Service</a>
    <a href="/risk-disclaimer" class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary hover:text-primary-container transition-colors">Risk Disclaimer</a>
    <a href="/regulatory-disclosure" class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary hover:text-primary-container transition-colors">Regulatory Disclosure</a>
  </div>
</div>

</BaseLayout>
